<section class="review-section" id="overview">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>Veras AI, developed by Evolve Lab and launched in 2023, is an AI-powered rendering plugin that transforms basic 3D models into photorealistic visualizations. It integrates directly with SketchUp and Revit, bringing the power of generative AI to architects' existing workflows without requiring a complete software change.</p>
<p>The platform has quickly gained popularity among over 30,000 designers who appreciate the ability to create presentation-quality renders in minutes rather than hours. Unlike traditional rendering engines that require extensive material setup and lighting configuration, Veras AI uses machine learning to intelligently interpret your model and generate realistic images.</p>
<p>What makes Veras AI particularly valuable is its understanding of architectural context. The AI recognizes building elements, applies appropriate materials, adds realistic entourage, and creates atmospheric lighting—all based on your design intent and simple text prompts.</p>
<div class="veras-highlight">
<h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg> Instant Photorealistic Renders</h4>
<p style="margin: 0;">Turn rough SketchUp or Revit models into stunning photorealistic renders in under 2 minutes. No material setup or lighting configuration required.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="review-section" id="features">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg> Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 017.38 16.75 2 2 0 01-3.5.54l-.9-1.34a2 2 0 00-1.65-.88H9.87a2 2 0 01-1.99-2.33L8.53 12a2 2 0 00-.26-1.5L6.8 8.53a10 10 0 015.2-6.53z"></path><circle cx="7.5" cy="10.5" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="18.5" cy="7.5" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="16.5" cy="13.5" r=".5"></circle></svg> AI Rendering</h4><p>Transform basic 3D models into photorealistic images using advanced generative AI. Automatic material interpretation and lighting setup.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 21a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a4 4 0 0 1-4 4zm0 0a4 4 0 0 0 4-4v-4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4a4 4 0 0 0 4 4"/><path d="M7 10h0M17 10h0"/></svg> Style Control</h4><p>Choose from various rendering styles—photorealistic, watercolor, sketch, or custom. Text prompts fine-tune the aesthetic direction.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="7" y="7" width="10" height="12" rx="1"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3"/></svg> SketchUp/Revit Plugins</h4><p>Native integration with SketchUp and Revit. Render directly from your model without exporting or switching applications.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg> Instant Visualization</h4><p>Generate renders in 1-2 minutes. Perfect for rapid design exploration and client feedback sessions.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/></svg> Material Editing</h4><p>Refine AI-suggested materials with simple controls. Adjust finishes, colors, and textures to match your vision.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path><path d="M15.09 14c.18-.98.65-1.74 1.41-2.5A4.65 4.65 0 0018 8a6 6 0 10-12 0c0 1.33.47 2.48 1.5 3.5.76.76 1.23 1.52 1.41 2.5"></path></svg> Lighting Simulation</h4><p>AI automatically creates realistic lighting based on time of day, location, and building orientation. Manual overrides available.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 21h18M9 8h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1M5 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"/></svg> Exterior/Interior Scenes</h4><p>Optimized for both exterior and interior architectural visualization. Understands spatial context and applies appropriate treatments.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"/><polyline points="1 20 1 14 7 14"/><path d="M3.51 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.85-3.36L23 10M1 14l4.64 4.36A9 9 0 0 0 20.49 15"/></svg> Fast Iterations</h4><p>Generate multiple variations quickly. Explore different material palettes, lighting conditions, and styles effortlessly.</p></div>
</div>
