<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z"></path><line x1="4" x2="4" y1="22" y2="15"></line></svg> Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-card">
<h3><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg> Advantages</h3>
<ul>
<li>Incredibly fast render times</li>
<li>Seamless plugin integration</li>
<li>Photorealistic output quality</li>
<li>No complex material setup needed</li>
<li>Works with existing models</li>
<li>Great for client presentations</li>
<li>Multiple style options</li>
<li>Regular AI improvements</li>
<li>Responsive support team</li>
<li>Active user community</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="cons-card">
<h3><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="15" x2="9" y1="9" y2="15"></line><line x1="9" x2="15" y1="9" y2="15"></line></svg> Disadvantages</h3>
<ul>
<li>Paid only—no free tier</li>
<li>Subscription can be pricey</li>
